      "content": "thanks for this. it's a decent start but honestly it's a bit too brief. the partner is going to want to see a bit more substance regarding the actual terms we're looking for. \n\ncan you expand this? we need to suggest that they cover at least 60% of the lost revenue as a settlement. try to weave in more of those \"reasonableness\" terms so the partner sees we're being serious about being conciliatory, but like i said before, please don't just keyword-stuff it. it should still read like a serious legal demand that actually defends Miller's rights. make it more detailed about the impact of the delay.",
